-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col\"><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\"><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex justify-end\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-controls\" class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 条/ 共 3 条</span><div class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"上一条客户评价\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><use href=\"/icons/cms/27bb77900ed6df73/arrow-left-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></use></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 text-primary-60 hover:bg-primary-4 hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 focus:outline-primary-44 -ms-1 active:scale-95\" aria-label=\"下一条客户评价\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><use href=\"/icons/cms/27bb77900ed6df73/arrow-right-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)] px-6 py-8\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\" class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\"><div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 grid w-full\"><figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Basis\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/basis-quote-logo.d3840a1a.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">GPT-6.2 Astra 能更好地规划长程执行路径，更高效地编写 Bash，以更少的交互轮次完成更多工作，因此在 Token 和工具使用效率上比 GPT-6 Astra 有了巨大提升。我们处理长程会计工作的平均耗时减少了 50%，其中最复杂工作的耗时最多减少了 73%。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Eros Wang，Basis 技术团队成员</figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ramp\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/ramp-quote-logo.96a32a3f.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">GPT-6.2 Astra 在推理和系统设计方面取得了显著进步。在我的测试中，它处理复杂项目时展现出更强的架构判断力，能够兼顾理论可能性与现实约束。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Daniel Bjanes，Ramp 高级 AI 应用工程师</figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Jump Trading\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/jump-quote-logo.8925a054.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">GPT-6.2 Astra 像经验丰富的研究者一样处理复杂优化问题，从第一性原理出发推理，并从自身的失误中学习，找到更好的路径。它将我们的硬件性能发挥到了极限，并在一项沿用超过三年的基准测试中达到了饱和水平。它不到一天就达到了我原以为不可能实现的目标。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Adam Alnasser，Jump Trading 技术团队成员</figcaption></figure></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-0 w-full\"><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div></div></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-tail\" class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 -translate-inline-1/2 pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[-0.4rem] z-1 hidden size-3 rotate-45 rounded-xs border-e border-b md:block\" style=\"inset-inline-start:16.666666666666664%\"></span></div><div class=\"relative